  {
    "id": "garden-of-life-sport-organic-plant-protein",
    "name": "Garden of Life Sport Organic Plant-Based Protein",
    "brand": "Garden of Life",
    "badge": "Best Overall Certified Gluten-Free",
    "category": "Organic pea-led plant protein",
    "description": "Garden of Life's Sport powder stacks up more independent checks than anything else here. Retailer and brand listings at the time of writing describe it as NSF Certified Gluten-Free, and it is also NSF Certified for Sport and USDA Organic, per the brand. A two-scoop serving gives about 30 g of plant protein in around 170-180 calories, sweetened with stevia. It is also dairy-free and soy-free, which helps people with celiac disease who react to other foods too.",
