      "Premium cost per 25 g of protein",
      "Check each flavor, especially dessert and cereal flavors"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The whey to choose if you want a well-known isolate with a clear gluten-free label claim.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per scoop": "25 g (label)",
      "Gluten-free status": "Gluten-free claim (per brand)",
      "Protein source": "Whey isolate",
      "Best for": "Mainstream whey drinkers"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "owyn-pro-elite-protein-powder",
