    "description": "OWYN states that its products meet an internal gluten standard of under 10 ppm, half the FDA's 20 ppm limit, and markets the range as free of the major food allergens. The Pro Elite chocolate panel at the time of writing lists 30 g of pea and pumpkin protein in 180 calories per two-scoop serving, with 0 g of sugar and monk fruit sweetening. Some OWYN products show a Certified Gluten-Free badge, so check the tub for the seal.",
