      "About 180 calories per serving"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The best pick for households avoiding gluten and several other allergens at once.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "30 g (label)",
      "Gluten-free status": "Under 10 ppm brand standard",
      "Protein source": "Pea + pumpkin",
